{{Term/Store|Stealth Mask|Stealth Masks|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/> Stealth Masks go unnamed in {{SSBU}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Stealth Mask is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be purchased at [[Enchanted]] in [[Kakariko Village]]. According to its description, the [[Sheikah]] crafting techniques used to make the Mask suppress the noisy rustling of clothes.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When worn, it provides one level of [[Stealth Up]]. The Stealth Mask can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Stealth Mask, alongside the [[Stealth Chest Guard]] and [[Stealth Tights]], compose the [[Stealth Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides the [[Night Speed Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

